{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "title": "llm-d Scenarios: P/D Disaggregation and Precise Prefix Caching",
  "uid": "llm-d-scenarios",
  "tags": ["llm-d", "benchmark"],
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "10s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "datasource",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "type": "datasource"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Run `bench/illustrative-benchmark.sh`, then set the time range to Last 15 minutes.\n\n- **Scenario A (precise prefix caching):** the engine hit rate and the EPP cached ratio rise, and time-to-first-token falls, as a prefix is reused.\n- **Scenario B (P/D disaggregation):** requests are split into `prefill-decode` by the decider."
      }
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Scenario A - Precise Prefix Caching",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Engine prefix-cache hit rate (simulator)",
      "description": "vllm:prefix_cache_hits_total / vllm:prefix_cache_queries_total. Rises when a prefix is reused. Split by pod role.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15 }, "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (llm_d_ai_role) (rate(vllm:prefix_cache_hits_total[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (llm_d_ai_role) (rate(vllm:prefix_cache_queries_total[5m])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{llm_d_ai_role}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "EPP predicted cached-token ratio (prefill)",
      "description": "Share of prompt tokens the EPP predicts already cached on the prefill pod. llm_d_epp_prefix_predicted_cached_tokens_sum / llm_d_epp_prefix_prompt_tokens_sum.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.25 }, { "color": "green", "value": 0.6 } ] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "area" },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(llm_d_epp_prefix_predicted_cached_tokens_sum{endpoint_role=\"prefill\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(llm_d_epp_prefix_prompt_tokens_sum{endpoint_role=\"prefill\"}[$__range])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "cached ratio" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time-to-first-token (mean) - the latency payoff",
      "description": "Mean TTFT from the simulator. Lower when the prefix is cached (fewer prefill tokens). vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds sum/count.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 }, "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_sum[2m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_count[2m])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "mean TTFT" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Scenario B - P/D Disaggregation",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disaggregation decisions per second, by type",
      "description": "llm_d_epp_disagg_decision_total. prefill-decode = request was split into prefill + decode.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 20, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } }, "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (decision_type) (rate(llm_d_epp_disagg_decision_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{decision_type}}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Decision mix over the window",
      "description": "Share of each decision type across the selected range. increase(llm_d_epp_disagg_decision_total).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "options": { "legend": { "showLegend": true, "placement": "right", "values": ["value"] }, "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        { "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum by (decision_type) (increase(llm_d_epp_disagg_decision_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{decision_type}}" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": []
}
